<title>USA: Valley completes Midland Bancorporation deal.</title>
<headline>Valley completes Midland Bancorporation deal.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valley National Bancorp said Tuesday it has completed its merger with Midland Bancorporation, increasing its asset size 9 percent to $5.1 billion and its branch network to 95 offices.</p>
<p>Midland's principal subsidiary, the Midland Bank and Trust Co of Paramus, N.J., has assets of $440 million and operates 13 branches.</p>
</text>
